Package: libdtk2widget6
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gxde-qt6integration
Multi-Arch: same
Description: Deepin graphical user interface library (Qt6 port of DTK 2.x)
 Qt6 port of the legacy dtkwidget 2.x. Provides libdtk2widget.so.6 which
 coexists with:
   - libdtkwidget2  (Qt5 build of DTK 2.x, SONAME .so.2, master branch)
   - libdtk6widget  (DTK 6.x, separate library)
 .
 SONAME, pkg-config name (dtk2widget) and header path (/usr/include/dtk2)
 all carry the "dtk2" prefix to avoid collision with the other two.

Package: libdtk2widget6-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 libdtk2widget6 (= ${binary:Version}),
 qt6-base-dev, libdtk6core-dev, libdtk6log-dev, libdtk6gui-dev 
Description: Deepin graphical user interface library (Qt6 port, dev files)
 Headers, pkg-config (dtk2widget.pc) and qmake module
 (qt_lib_dtk2widget.pri) for the Qt6 port of DTK 2.x.
